rname>Kleinfelder</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name><name><surname>Lange</surname><given-names>DE</given-names></name><name><surname>Bocker</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Some effects of non-surgical therapy on gingival inflammatory cell subsets in patients with adult and early-onset periodontitis</article-title><source>J Periodontol</source><year>2000</year><volume>71</volume><fpage>1561</fpage><lpage>1566</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11063388</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1902/jop.2000.71.10.1561</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kleinfelder</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name><name><surname>Sculean</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Lange</surname><given-names>DE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Some effects of non-surgical therapy on gingival inflammatory cell subsets in patients with early-onset periodontitis associated with <italic>Actinobacillus actinomycetemcomitans</italic></article-title><source>J Periodontol</source><year>2001</year><volume>72</volume><fpage>1713</fpage><lpage>1719</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11811507</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1902/jop.2001.72.12.1713</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Erciyas</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Orbak</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Kavrut</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Demir</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Kaya</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The changes in T lymphocyte subsets following periodontal treatment in patients with chronic periodontitis</article-title><source>J Periodontal Res</source><year>2006</year><volume>41</volume><fpage>165</f